    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Bargain with Whimsical Fey</p></blockquote><p>Your pact draws on the power of the Feywild. When you choose this subclass, you might strike a bargain with an archfey such as the Prince of Frost; the Queen of Air and Darkness, ruler of the Gloaming Court; Titania of the Summer Court; or an ancient hag. Or you might call on a whole range of Fey, weaving a web of favors and debts. Whoever they are, your patron is often inscrutable and whimsical.</p><h3>Archfey Patron Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.kBHPVB14cgxKKbLR]{Archfey Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.fE1FeFndUtyctOaT]{Steps of the Fey}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.UEjYHLiLt8lQlwPR]{Misty Escape}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.AQ3MngCpD2kYvpis]{Beguiling Defenses}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7gECsNykt4lxHPQi]{Bewitching Magic}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Archfey Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Warlock Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCalmEmotio]{Calm Emotions}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFaerieFire]{Faerie Fire}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMistyStep0]{Misty Step}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbPhantasmalFor]{Phantasmal Force}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSleep00000]{Sleep}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlink00000]{Blink}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPlantGrowt]{Plant Growth}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominateBe]{Dominate Beast}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterInv]{Greater Invisibility}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominatePe]{Dominate Person}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSeeming000]{Seeming}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
